    <h1 class="ai-alert__title">
<span>TTR-Compressor Matches MLP Merger With 55.6% Fewer Visual Tokens</span>
</h1>

    <div class="ai-alert__byline">
      By <a rel="author" href="/about#alexis-dufresne">Alexis Dufresne</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      Published
      <time datetime="2026-10-23T03:35:45+00:00">October 23, 2026 at 03:35 UTC</time>
